{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "domain of it:\n  x: u32, 0..4294967295\n  n: u32, 0..4294967295\n  requires 0 <= n < 32  (shift amount; C UB otherwise)\n  defined at 6 of 65536 points\n  undefined e.g. at x=0, n=4294967294; x=0, n=4294967295; x=200494509, n=40788086; x=3851444534, n=915262580\n  C undefined behaviour at 65530 points, e.g. x=0, n=4294967294\n  sampled 65536 points (domain has 2^64 or more points); not exhaustive\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 4, "ok": true, "cmd": "domain", "ucas": "it(x: u32, n: u32) = x << n\ndomain it", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "domain", "conditions": [{"kind": "requires", "text": "0 <= n < 32  (shift amount; C UB otherwise)"}], "defined_points": 6, "points": 65536, "exhaustive": false, "c_ub_points": 65530, "undefined_example": "x=0, n=4294967294; x=0, n=4294967295; x=200494509, n=40788086; x=3851444534, n=915262580", "c_ub_example": "x=0, n=4294967294"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "domain of it:\n  x: u32, 0..4294967295\n  n: u32, 0..4294967295\n  requires 0 <= n < 32  (shift amount; C UB otherwise)\n  defined at 6 of 65536 points\n  undefined e.g. at x=0, n=4294967294; x=0, n=4294967295; x=200494509, n=40788086; x=3851444534, n=915262580\n  C undefined behaviour at 65530 points, e.g. x=0, n=4294967294\n  sampled 65536 points (domain has 2^64 or more points); not exhaustive\n"}, "isError": false}}
